      "message": "test(app): raise the shared C-axis fixtures' clearance over the box stock\n\nThe first record of their Rotary Contour (r 2.0, Z28 at clearance 25)\nstood inside the 14x14x34 box stock, so the lathe post's G00 X Z went\ninto uncut stock; the #3096 law refuses it. Clearance 40 keeps what\neach test pins.\n\nRefs #3096\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
