      "message": "test(app): pin the rewind conviction on a mill and the mill-turn's first-rapid refusal\n\nOn the mill-turn the first rapid of the clearance-25 contour stands\ninside the box stock, so the #3096 law refuses it by name first; the\norbit's RapidInStock conviction is read on the same bench declared a\nmill, where #2965's swept law reports FirstTraverseLow.\n\nRefs #3096\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
